 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Anstatt … zu",
     "texto": [
      "**Anstatt** + infinitive with **zu** means «instead of»: **Anstatt zu reisen, lese ich Bücher** (instead of travelling, I read books). It is more formal than «statt … zu».",
      "If the subject changes, **anstatt dass** is used with a full clause: **Anstatt dass wir reisen, bleiben wir zu Hause** (instead of us travelling, we stay at home)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "um … zu in history texts",
     "texto": [
      "**Um … zu** expresses purpose with the same subject: **Die Römer bauten Straßen, um Städte zu verbinden** (the Romans built roads to connect cities). With a different subject «damit» is used."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
